From a138a8bdff3299d1ae7abeb919efe2921327b884 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: devilAPI <felixseiboldt@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 08:15:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/15] axon7: blobs in both lib and lib64 as prebuilt modules

Android 15 turns PRODUCT_COPY_FILES under lib/ into
prebuilt_renderscript_bitcode modules whose 64-bit install base is lib64,
so lib/X.so and lib64/X.so collide in the generated system and vendor
images (soong: packaging conflict at lib64/X.so). Mark the 105 libraries
that exist in both lib and lib64 of one partition with - and DISABLE_DEPS,
as msm8996-common does, so extract_utils declares them as
cc_prebuilt_library_shared.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FVN6i1nM3y1ifpqjS4n7PW
Change-Id: I14e2d4fa190c8bbcb82f879ba3ad9137bd9f5985
---
